<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64464" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰδ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be moist</i> or <i>sodden</i>, of a disease in
			fig-trees, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of hair,
				<i>fall off</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				15.18
			</span></i>; of persons, <i>to be bald</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				266
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				3.32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.88
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τὰς τρίχας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sotion
					p.186
				</span></i>
			 W.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐάν τινι μαδήσῃ ἡ κεφαλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					13.40
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν μαδήσῃ</span> if
				<i>there is baldness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.189
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
